                    <div class="welcome"><h1><span>About Us</span></h1><br />
                      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The<b> Xplorigen Technologies Pvt. Ltd. </b>is a Contract Research and Service Organization providing diverse solutions to Biotechnology, Bioinformatics, Cheminformatics, Pharmacogenomics and Biopharmaceuticals based projects in organizations and companies. On the basis of customer requirement we are providing the best customized solutions at all stages to improve upon their Research and Development activities.  We are adequately prepared to provide diverse bioinformatics support and training to the academic organizations and research community.  Our goal is to ensure that scientists across the world are able to effectively exploit existing and emerging computational technologies, especially related to OMICs scale datasets as well as to assist our customers to make finer assessment of their requirement by bringing them high end data management solutions, data mining and predictive analytics softwares. Our Biostatistical data mining, Data management, Data Integration and data analysis services will help interrelated companies and organizations to maximize the worth of their data and to develop new strategic and operational understanding.
                       <br><br><br>
                           <b>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Xplorigen Technologies</b> is also actively engaged into novel algorithm development and optimization and to create software that implements best-of-breed algorithms to improve data analysis process. Moreover, we offer a wide range of student projects, at undergraduate and postgraduate level in Bioinformatics, Biotechnology, Cheminformatics and Pharmacogenomics. All the projects deserve their own publication potential. Students will get a chance to enroll in “Institutional Ongoing Projects” in the concern field, which will help them to understand the real time process involved in the advance data analysis methodologies.
